# Stretched, looping, held at the C4 root and sped up an octave (timeStretchAmount 12). Each hop lands its new
# play-head half a beam ahead of the stretch position, so near the source's end it can land past the waveform and
# that play-head goes silent; the loop end then re-initialises the stretcher with only the older play-head sounding,
# and the hop it forces starts from silence.
4608 90 3C 64
80000 80 3C 40
